SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: Latinas Leading Business
LOCATION:Scotties
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 86 spots lef
 t\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/2
 03636\n\n6:30PM Reception\, 7:00PM Discussion\n\nIn celebration of Hispan
 ic Heritage Month\, join us for a ’Quin Chat that shines a light on the 
 growing influence of Latinas shaping America’s economic future. Drawing
  from a new national study focused on U.S. Latinas\, the conversation wi
 ll explore their expanding  economic power\, leadership\, and impact—an
 d why this generation of leaders represents a force poised to shape the f
 uture of business and the broader U.S. economy.\n\nThe research began in 2
 025\, when the Latino Donor Collaborative\, Hispanics in Philanthropy\, an
 d We Are ALX - grant recipient of The 'Quin Impact Fund - a joined forces 
 to envision a national study capturing the economic contributions and pote
 ntial of U.S. Latinas. Moderated by Nathalie Rayes\, former U.S. Ambassado
 r to Croatia and civic leader\, the conversation brings together three of 
 the original thought partners behind the study: Eneida Roman\, President a
 nd CEO of We Are ALX and a nationally recognized advocate for advancing wo
 men and Latinos\; Ana Marie Argilagos\, former President & CEO of Hispanic
 s in Philanthropy\; and Ana Valdez\, President & CEO of the Latino Donor C
 ollaborative. Together\, they will share the story behind the research\, a
 nd consider what the rising influence of Latinas means for business\, lead
 ership\, and philanthropy.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved fo
 r members only. Complimentary light bites and refreshments will be served
 . We kindly ask that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior to 
 the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/203636
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
