SUMMARY:Invited Dress Preview: To Kill a Mockingbird 
LOCATION:The Huntington Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nStatus: You are on Waitlist\nE
 vent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/205639\n\n6:00PM Recepti
 on & Gallery Viewing\, 7:00PM Curtain\n\nGo behind the curtain for an excl
 usive first look at The Huntington Theatre’s To Kill a Mockingbird. The 
 evening begins with a privae reception in The Maso Studio\, where members 
 will enjoy an immersive introduction to the production’s inspiration and
  explore key set pieces that bring its world to life. Following the recept
 ion\, members will be guided into the main theatre for a closed final dres
 s rehearsal.\n\nExperience the energy and anticipation of the days leading
  up to opening night as the cast and creative team refine scenes\, work th
 rough director’s notes\, adjust pacing\, revisit line readings\, and put
  the finishing touches on the performance. It’s an intimate look at the 
 artistry\, collaboration\, and precision that happen behind the curtain be
 fore the house lights go down.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserve
 d for members only. Complimentary light bites and beverages will be served
 . We kindly ask that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior to 
 the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/205639
CATEGORIES:The Arts
